/**
 * @defgroup PamsTables pams/tables — Table Build Infrastructure
 * @ingroup Pams
 * @{
 *
 * @brief Build infrastructure that links all PAMS table libraries into St_Tables.so.
 *
 * @details
 * The `pams/tables/` package contains no source code.  It provides two build-system
 * files:
 *
 * - **`Conscript`** — Perl build script for the `cons` build system.  Collects the
 *   per-subsystem `*_Tables` shared libraries (gen, emc, ctf, ftpc, global, sim, svt,
 *   geometry, StDb) and links them into the unified `St_Tables.so` library that is
 *   installed in `$STAR/lib/`.
 *
 * - **`makeIdls.sh`** — Utility shell script that regenerates IDL table schema files
 *   from the STAR conditions database (StarDB) using `dbMakeFiles.pl`.  Accepts the
 *   database name and server name as arguments.
 *
 * ## Build graph
 * ```
 * pams/<pkg>/idl/*.idl  →  <pkg>_Tables.so  ─┐
 *                                              ├──► St_Tables.so
 * (all subsystems)                            ─┘
 * ```
 *
 * @}
 */
